      "instance_name": "woman",
      "label": "Black woman",
      "description": "A Black woman with dark, curly hair, shown from the shoulders up, with her mouth wide open in an exaggerated expression. Her eyes are rolled back, and her teeth are visible, conveying a look of distress, aggression, or primal reaction. She appears to be lying down or reclining, with one hand near her neck or shoulder. The lighting is dramatic, highlighting her face against a dark background.",
