      "instance_name": "primal_reaction_scene",
      "label": "Primal Reaction Scene",
      "description": "A scene depicting a Black woman with an exaggerated, distressed, or aggressive facial expression, with her mouth wide open and eyes rolled back, conveying a primal or animalistic reaction. The scene is juxtaposed with the text 'when you ask the stroke patient to smile,' creating a harmful and misleading analogy. The woman appears to be lying down or reclining, with one hand near her neck or shoulder, under dramatic lighting against a dark background.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
