      "@type": "ToxicityAssessment",
      "instance_name": "toxicity_1",
      "label": "Harmful",
      "description": "The meme uses a vulnerable medical condition (stroke) to generate shock humor, potentially stigmatizing stroke patients and reinforcing negative stereotypes about Black people by associating them with primal or animalistic behavior. The visual of the woman's expression, combined with the text, is designed to provoke a reaction through shock value, which can be harmful by reducing a serious medical condition to a joke and by potentially reinforcing racial stereotypes.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
