    {
      "@id": "http://example.org/multimodal-taxonomy#dimension_7bb893ef",
      "@type": "TargetCommunity",
      "instance_name": "audience_id",
      "label": "audience description",
      "description": "The target audience for this meme is individuals who are familiar with or enjoy shock humor that relies on racial stereotypes and ableist tropes. The meme is designed to provoke laughter through discomfort by juxtaposing a medical condition (stroke patient) with a racially charged, primal visual of a Black woman. This suggests the audience likely includes people who find humor in dehumanizing or mocking vulnerable groups, particularly those who may hold or reinforce anti-Black stereotypes or ableist views. The meme’s toxicity and reliance on harmful analogies indicate it targets an audience that either does not recognize the harm or actively seeks out content that reinforces prejudice, particularly through the lens of racialized shock humor.",
      "belongsToAnalysis": {
